# Runtime data only. Nothing in this directory belongs in the repository.
#
# clips/ holds camera frames of Grayson's BEDROOM — the alarm's evidence and
# the pictures that let a surprising calibration be checked against reality.
# They must never leave this machine, and the home directory is a git repo with
# a GitHub origin, so an unguarded `git add` would push them.
#
# samples/ is tens of megabytes of raw sensing recordings, regenerable in four
# minutes with `roomwatch sample`. state.json and events.jsonl are live state.
#
# The measured RESULT of all this — roomwatch-baseline.json — lives one level
# up and IS tracked, because the thresholds and the verdict are the part worth
# keeping.
*
!.gitignore
